OL,3,GNEWSA'Frustrating' 24/7 drilling
OL,4,Acausing residents headaches and sleep
OL,5,Adeprivation
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn around-the-clock drilling operation
OL,8,Fin a park is having a "major impact" on
OL,9,Fthe lives of local residents by causing
OL,10,Fheadaches and sleep deprivation.
OL,12,FThe pumping station at Hailey Park, in
OL,13,FCardiff, has been a long-standing issue
OL,14,Fin the area, with one resident saying
OL,15,Fshe can "feel it" almost everywhere in
OL,16,Fher house.
OL,18,FWhile plans were approved in 2022, a
OL,19,Fseries of delays, a legal challenge and
OL,20,Fdamage to machinery caused by a
OL,21,Fwaterlogged site has meant progress has
OL,22,Fmoved slowly.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
