OL,3,GNEWSA'Frustrating' 24/7 drilling
OL,4,Acausing residents headaches and sleep
OL,5,Adeprivation
OL,6,
OL,7,FWelsh Water said the 24-hour tunnelling
OL,8,Fis required to "carry out this phase of
OL,9,Fthe work safely" and it was working
OL,10,Fwith residents to mitigate the
OL,11,Fdisturbances as much as possible.
